second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What sport is Altrincham associated with?\", \"slot_hint\": \"sport\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 22, \"text\": \"one win and one draw).\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d00\", \"start\": 23, \"end\": 237, \"text\": \"At the end of the 1901–02 season, the County Leagues elected 18 teams to join the new Division 2 (7 from Lancashire and 10 from Yorkshire and new member South Shields) with the existing second competition scrapped.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d00\", \"start\": 238, \"end\": 470, \"text\": \"Altrincham were one of the 4 Yorkshire (Goole, Heckmondwike, Liversedge and Sowerby Bridge) and 2 Lancashire clubs (the other being Radcliffe) not elected to the new Division 2, but it is unknown as to which route the club followed.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d00\", \"start\": 471, \"end\": 600, \"text\": \"In the single season in which Altrincham played semi-professional rugby league, 1901–02, there are few records readily available.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d00\", \"start\": 601, \"end\": 605, \"text\": \"Some\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 22, \"text\": \"One win and one draw).\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d01\", \"start\": 23, \"end\": 237, \"text\": \"At the end of the 1901–02 season, the County Leagues elected 18 teams to join the new Division 2 (7 from Lancashire and 10 from Yorkshire and new member South Shields) with the existing second competition scrapped.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d01\", \"start\": 238, \"end\": 470, \"text\": \"Altrincham were one of the 4 Yorkshire (Goole, Heckmondwike, Liversedge and Sowerby Bridge) and 2 Lancashire clubs (the other being Radcliffe) not elected to the new Division 2, but it is unknown as to which route the club followed.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d01\", \"start\": 471, \"end\": 595, \"text\": \"In the single season in which Altrincham played semi-professional cricket, 1901–02, there are few records readily available.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d01\", \"start\": 596, \"end\": 600, \"text\": \"Some\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 39, \"text\": \"North at the end of the 2010–11 season.\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d02\", \"start\": 40, \"end\": 172, \"text\": \"In 2012–13 a fourth-place finish saw them qualify for the promotion play-offs, in which they lost 4–2 on aggregate to Brackley Town.\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d02\", \"start\": 173, \"end\": 383, \"text\": \"However, after finishing fourth the following season, they beat Hednesford Town 4–3 on aggregate in the semi-finals and then defeated Guiseley 2–1 in the final to earn promotion back to the Conference National.\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d02\", \"start\": 384, \"end\": 492, \"text\": \"In 2015–16 the club finished in the relegation zone and were relegated to the renamed National League North.\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d02\", \"start\": 493, \"end\": 613, \"text\": \"The following season they finished bottom of the National League North, leading to a second successive relegation to the\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Altrincham\", \"scope\": \"sport\", \"claim\": \"Altrincham is associated with rugby league.\", \"answer\": \"rugby league\", \"quote\": \"In the single season in which Altrincham played semi-professional rugby league, 1901–02, there are few records readily available.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0224-e624f35595c8:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Altrincham\", \"scope\": \"sport\", \"claim\": \"Altrincham is associated with cricket.\", \"answer\": \"Cricket\", \"quote\": \"In the single season in which Altrincham played semi-professional cricket, 1901–02, there are few records readily available.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"rugby league\", \"cricket\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"rugby league\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"cricket\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"football\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
